      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00280",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave a bounded closure summary with separate acute, medication, infection, and pathology/follow-up threads.",
        "quote": "今晚到后天复换前先这样守着是可以的，重点还是盯那些红旗。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00470",
        "explanation": "The doctor explicitly stated which issues are temporarily handled, which residual risks remain, and assigned follow-up owners.",
        "quote": "现在继续这样做：\n- 抗生素、止痛药按袋子标签用，不自己加量、不断药\n- 不自己碰里面的敷料或再处理伤口深处\n- 少量多次吃点东西、喝水，尽量别空腹太久\n- 病理没出前先不自己猜"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The final doctor message provides a prioritized plan with specific actions, monitoring thresholds, and a clear fallback path to the emergency department, while the family confirms understanding.",
